# Meta hygiene

- One concern per rule or skill; name files for the workflow or constraint.
- Skill frontmatter `description` must state when to use the skill (triggers).
- Requirements docs state must/should constraints, not implementation diaries.
- Requirements changes must create/update project skills (see `requirements-skills-sync`).
- When deriving a new project from this template, rewrite `README.md` for the product and keep `AGENTS.md` accurate for that repo.
